                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0491214-8e40-4220-9aaa-b7ef2a6cbacf",
                                "sense_id": "61d7cda7-e10c-310d-8bcb-f755c9d0fc8b",
                                "text": "Худо́й, седова́тый, с подстри́женными у́сиками на ли́сьем бри́том перга́ментном лице́ челове́к в бога́той черке́ске с сере́бряными газыря́ми замета́лся у зерка́л.",
                                "translation": "A thin, graying man with narrow, clipped moustaches on his foxy, clean-shaven, parchment-like face was pacing in front of the mirrors; he was dressed in a fancy Circassian coat with ornamental silver cartridge-cases.",
                                "english": "A thin, graying man with narrow, clipped moustaches on his foxy, clean-shaven, parchment-like face was pacing in front of the mirrors; he was dressed in a fancy Circassian coat with ornamental silver cartridge-cases."
